T252	Quotation 26347 26618	"None at all. I was inclined to think at one time that he knew who had done it and was screening him or her, but I am convinced now that he is as puzzled as everyone else. He is not a very quick-witted youth, though comely to look at and, I should think, sound at heart."
T253	Quotation 37140 37155	"Nous verrons,"
